# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-only
# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): Partner and Shift on the Tunings (Evan, 2026-11-07). Drone I on D3,
# drone II on A3, both partners on (par12, par33), no Detune (par4, par25), drone I's a fifth (par3 12), drone II's a
# just fifth (par24 13); the Swell, Drift and Movement off (par55, par52, par75). 12-tone, then LMY (par110 7), 19-tone
# (2), Harmonics (6): the partners on each Tuning's fifth; then Shift latched (E5, w13): its +700c is no note of LMY or
# 19-tone, so it moves 700c; a click down (Pitch moves' KNOB 1) lands on 19-tone's note, "+5th" (695c). The Partner
# page on 19-tone ("+5th", no "just"), Pitch moves on LMY. Not a test of its own.
notips
set 74 0
set 51 0
set 55 0
set 52 0
set 75 0
set 0 5000
set 21 5700
set 12 1
set 33 1
set 4 0
set 25 0
set 3 12
set 24 13
tap PLAY
wait 1500
wav tuning-intervals.wav
wait 4000
set 110 7
wait 4000
set 110 2
wait 4000
tap GLO
tap GLO
set 110 2
spin K1 1
spin K1 -1
tap SEQ
expect view 8
wait 600
shot tuning-partner.png
set 110 6
wait 4000
set 110 7
tapkey w13
wait 4000
set 110 2
wait 2000
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
spin K1 -1
wait 2000
tap GLO
tap GLO
set 110 7
spin K1 1
spin K1 -1
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
expect view 9
wait 600
shot tuning-shift.png
tapkey w13
wait 3000
wavstop
